Mini-fix uploaded:
- Fixed crashes from the server when trading on the secondary market;
- Optimized clouds and fog;

- Fixed a bug with firing automatic turrets;
- Fixed some problems with the cockpit (it could be duplicated)
- Set a maximum limit of items in space per sector (to optimize massive fights with a lot of drops)

Update #11 has been uploaded!

We've added unique special abilities to ships, optimized server performance, and added new voice acting for the Friend OS.

List of changes:
- Added unique special abilities for each ship. To use the ability, press the X key;
- Added voice acting for OS "Friend" when working with abilities;
- Added voice acting OS "Friend", a warning about the lack of insurance;
- Improved ship behavior when hitting obstacles;
- Fixed some bugs in the interface;
- Fixed display of keys in control settings and tooltips. Now they are displayed only on the English layout.

To download the update, restart the Steam client completely!

Patchfix uploaded:
- Fixed display of damage per second for weapons with additional. parameters;
- Fixed some bugs in the display of items when trading;
- Improved ship collision physics

- Fixed a problem with sticking items in the inventory and the inability to interact with them;
- Another optimization of transactions at stations and the work of items in the inventory when trading;
- Fixed the selection of several items at once (now the ship really collects everything);
- Fixed not working censorship filter;

Hello! We have uploaded another patch fix:
- Optimized work with the warehouse;
- Fixed incorrect item names in different menus;
- Improved synchronization of statistics of global events;
- Fixed autopilot route display;

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/35716072/866d97fdbc7132d1cb7a06e00778e3ae9fade41f.jpg[/img]

Update!
List of changes and innovations:

- Added 3D radar models;
- Added pollution of the ship's skin and the ability to wash it;
- Added ship repair function (now the hull is not restored for free);
- Added numerical values ​​in the description of the characteristics of the equipment;
- Added new loading screen;
- The sector and galaxy map can now be opened using the < > keys;
- Improved lighting;
- Added fog effect;
- Improved visualization of stars;

- Added the ability to select the nearest pirate on the R key;
- Added the ability to switch generator and turret modes to the F1-F8 keys;

- Added two global events;
- Added unique characteristics for items;

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/35716072/1bb72baf2ea7ae3896063b5288209ff8eb2d9ed1.jpg[/img]

Загружен мини-патч:
- Добавлено ограничение скорости автопилота на разных кораблях;
- Доработаны эффекты космической пыли во время полёта;
- Добавлен новый параметр в настройки графики - дальность детализации геометрии;

Загружен мини-патч:
- Исправлен баг с астероидами при добыче руды (если долго ковырять - начинались проблемы с рассинхроном);
- Исправлено окно карты, масштаб которого постоянно сбрасывался;
- Добавлена возможность масштабировать окно чата;
- Проведена оптимизация работы торговых NPC на сервере.

Загружен патч:
- Переписан игровой чат. Добавлено разделение на личные каналы;
- Исправлены некоторые баги с всплывающими уведомлениями о сообщениях;
- Добавлен новый канал чата, который позволяет переписываться на весь игровой мир.

Загружен патч:
- Добавлено отображение количества гиперпрыжков до цели в контрактах;
- Доработана физика поведения торгового корабля и корвета;
- Увеличена скорость автопилота;
- Исправлены несколько багов с автопилотом при выходе из врат; (но исправлены не все)
- Автопилот теперь может долететь до целевой станции даже в другой сектор (из меню поиска, из контракта);
- Увеличено время на выполнение контрактов по уничтожению станции и поиска пирата.

Загружен мини-патч:
- Добавлено отображение количества секторов, которые необходимо пересечь для достижения целевого сектора в окне поиска товаров;
- Добавлена возможность проложить маршрут до пиратской станции (раньше автопилот не включался из-за запрета стыковки со станцией);
- Добавлена возможность сортировки товаров на рынке по их типу;
- Исправлен баг с отображением целевого сектора в списке контрактов;
- Исправлен баг с невозможностью собрать предметы из лутбокса, если вы в отряде.

Загружен патч:
- Изменены габариты триггера входа во врата;
- Добавлен эффект "волны" для взрывов и задержка озвучки и вибрации (да, это не по физике, но мы художник и мы так видим);
- Улучшен музыкальный плеер - теперь музыка продолжает играть если вы пересекли врата, или пристыковались к станции;
- Добавлен новый полётный музыкальный трек;
- Исправлен баг, когда эффекты от промышленного лазера срабатывали даже если копаете руду не вы :)

Загружен патч:
- Улучшено меню поисковика: теперь при поиске товаров, они сортируются по цене. Станции, которые не имеют средств на счету - не отображаются в списке. Так же теперь можно увидеть сколько ресурсов станция готова купить;
- Добавлена функция автопилота в поисковике;
- Поисковик теперь доступен в любом секторе;
- Увеличена награда за контракты "Найти и уничтожить" и "Уничтожить пиратскую базу".

Improvements:
- Fixed autopilot when escorting a ship;
- Now if the escorted ship went to another sector - your ship will follow him;
- Increased the angle of rotation of the camera in the cockpit with a free view;

We are currently working on optimizing the server network code, expect new patches in the near future :)

Improved: loud unpleasant sound during maneuvers;
Improved: building a route by autopilot;
Fixed: chaotic disabling of the autopilot;
Fixed: numerous autopilot collisions in some situations;
Fixed: bug with duplicate cockpit when transferring between ships;
Fixed: display of the station name in the property manu.

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/35716072/78c34b16829ddf55604b013c4bc75543af35edd1.png[/img]
Список изменений и улучшений:

Added: New cockpit for the Explorer ship
Added: new mechanics and training for NPC ships and players;
Added: division of weapons into slot types;
Added: new type of weapon - heavy turret t-600;
Added: new type of ships - Corvette;
Added: new pirate NPC on the corvette;
Added: pirate bases now have three levels;
Added: new effects - space reality, small stones that make a little noise at high speed, hitting the hull .;
Added: disable automatic ship alignment;
Added: Disable environmental sound simulation - if you think that space without sound is more interesting, then this option is for you! :);
Added: visual display of the generator in the slot for some ships;
Added: disabling the horizon indicator in the cockpit - due to numerous complaints from the pilots;
Added: enabling censorship in the game settings - in case you have enough of foul language in your life;

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/35716072/2cf698be3bf29f51fabaee33e2095e647e700582.png[/img]

Improved: sounding of the ship's engines from the cockpit and from the third person;
Improved: NPC behavior during the battle;
Improved: visual effects from shots, lighting of dock platforms occupied by ships;
Improved: ship materials shading;
Improved: lighting, post-processing;
Improved: Explorer ship model;

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/35716072/a4051e3b49c9a323cd601fba10bfaa0401b22473.png[/img]

Improved: when opening the contract menu, the manual control mode is turned off;
Tweaked: if there is no production at the station, the trade menu is hidden;
Improved: animation of a loader when fulfilling a resource supply contract;
Improved: display of the target sector in supply contracts;
Tweaked: NPC ships are now equipped with weapons that fit their ship;
Reworked: ship physics. Balanced the maneuverability of all ships and their speed;
Improved: the ability to unload and load goods at your own station, without transferring money;

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/35716072/3bbb1ea7c33c57f8cb0b2ed972fc4f53fdd1d39f.png[/img]

Fixed: economic bug when delivering goods to the station;
Fixed some visual bugs in the interface;
Fixed: mini-game interface when mining ore at a distance of more than 1000m;
Fixed: disabling turrets for trade NPCs;
Fixed: homing NPCs - assassins in training mode and player death;
Fixed: reset target when using position marker;
Fixed: death during hyper transition;
Fixed: immortality on database crash;

Happy testing!

Hello! |
You've probably noticed a slight pause in the release of updates - and this is a good point! Due to the fact that the development team is not large, sometimes the pace of development can change.
But there is no reason to worry - work on the project is underway and from now on we will inform you more about the development process and release patches in small portions. We have just uploaded a small patch fix, and already in the first third of next month, you will see a larger update!
What's fixed now:
- Quick turn off stabilization is now possible only when reaching the third rank (to avoid accidentally pressing a key during training);
- Reworked the scale of some objects in the sectors (mainly stations);
- Fully identified and fixed a bug with aiming from a third-person view;
- Added new voice acting for NPCs;
- Other minor improvements.

In the next updates, we will delight you with new content, some mechanics and a new type of ships!

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/35716072/dfddb01795e69264b999bdb98589ea886e058103.png[/img]
The Galactic Council is on the air!
We are informing you of a major update this month. This time we have improved the training hints system, introduced a new ship for the BASTION corporation, improved the weapon system and added new mechanics. Here is a list of some of the innovations and changes:

- Added: New ship! Bastion Space Fighter "Wolf". The ship has 3 slots for modules. Additional modules can be purchased separately;
- Added: display of supported equipment classes for weapon slots;
- Added: limiting the class of weapons on ships;
- Added description of all weapon slots for ships and modules upon purchase;
- Added: generator energy redistribution mechanics;
- Added: automatic free ship insurance when buying / receiving a starter ship;
- Added: switching the inertia stabilization mode to the C key;
- Added: information about the volume of cargo in contracts for the transportation and extraction of resources;
- Added: a hint about the sector in which the factory for the transportation of goods is located;

- Improved: modules from ships can now increase the ship's durability and hold capacity;
- Improved: the weight of the resource "Microcircuits" is reduced by 2 times
- Improved: training sector;
- Improved: tips at the beginning of the game during training;
- Improved: physics of rotation and flight of the ship;

- Fixed: display of the players' mark in the squad, as well as the marks of pirates in the "sector defense" contract;
- Fixed: picking up containers on the Uranus ship

There is no more equipment of the "Engine" type - this type has been renamed to "Generator" and has new properties.
Now the energy of the generator is spent on: regenerating shields, firing cannons, maneuvering. You can distribute the generator energy as you wish
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/35716072/7de14eaa04e66a9c511449d719ad4cf9b9ea9e28.png[/img]

Fixed the appearance of extra "flying" screens in the cockpit;
Fixed the production demand of the energy component plant (there was not enough resource for production);
Fixed loading drone animation after unsuccessful transaction;
Fixed patrol ignoring violators;
Fixed: ship restoration under insurance now occurs at the last visited station;
Increased the pursuit speed of NPCs when their target tries to escape;
NPCs now shoot less accurately;
NPCs now try to maneuver more if they get too many hits;
Reduced the number of pirates at pirate stations;
Fixed random jumping into NPC gates;

Alarm! Meet the new patch! This time we focused on different aspects of the game, tried to listen to player reviews and fixed some bugs and shortcomings. In addition, many mechanics have been improved.
List of changes and innovations:

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/35716072/14b4353e78901dd9aa91bbd184db404d134bb9b9.jpg[/img]

Game world:
- Sector "Border" is supplemented with new objects, improved lighting;

Economy:
- Changed the maximum amount of consumed resources at stations. It now depends on the resource being produced;
- Fixed numerous errors in trading calculations;

Sector Map:
- Improved sector map:
- Now you can use the filter to sort the surrounding objects;
- All objects are now divided into categories: stations, gates, player ships, NPCs, items;
- The radius of the radar is now displayed on the map;
- Containers are now visible on the map;
- Improved the menu called on RMB in the map menu;
- Now the "Raise container" button activates the autopilot if the distance to the container is more than 300m. Upon arrival, the ship will automatically load the container into the hold;

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/35716072/37652904a05003584fea58486a1fda44adfeac53.jpg[/img]
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/35716072/49a92beb7c49880645016fab772c3690bd53fd8e.jpg[/img]

Ship:
- Changed the traverse speed of the cannons;
- Added a sound warning about a possible collision in manual control mode;
- When undocking, the cursor is centered;
- Improved autopilot;

NPC:
- The reward for the destruction of the pirate is now greater if the target is far away;
- Improved AI combat algorithm for NPCs;
- Now in battle, NPCs fly around obstacles much better;
- Now pirates appear in the docks of a pirate base when attacking a base;
- Now pirates defend the station in waves, instead of appearing endlessly;

Cockpit:
- Updated design of ship indicators. The merchant ship now has all the required sensors
- Improved camera behavior inside the cockpit
- Improved voice acting during the battle, added new effects;
- Now all sensors are functional in the cockpit of the merchant ship;

UI:
- Fixed display of the cost and number of items sold in the secondary market
- Fixed: when typing in chat, hotkeys no longer bring up various menus and functions

Server:
- Increased the number of packages for handling a hit on a ship and restoring a shield
- Improved shield balance system. Weaker shields are now capable of faster regeneration.

Friends! 2020 ended with a special event for us - we released our project to Early Access, and we are very glad that many of you really liked the game! Positive reviews of the game tell us about it.
We are glad to spend the outgoing year with you, and on this occasion we released another update in honor of the holiday!
List of innovations and changes:
- Added a new type of contracts: a mission to destroy a pirate station;
- New Year's items have been added: decorations for the ship's cockpit, a firecracker, as well as musical accompaniment on the theme of the holiday;
- Fixed some bugs with autopilot when completing contracts;
- Fixed a bug where a resource from a meteorite did not always appear;

First update with new content!
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/35716072/87514138ca310837d7cbb23aa83d826dae21b84a.jpg[/img]
List of changes and innovations:
Increased the probability of weapon heating;
- Patrol ships became even stronger and more persistent;
- Reduced weight of aluminum and titanium ore;
- All stations are now invulnerable (until the mechanics of protecting stations are introduced);
- Rebalanced prices for raw materials and equipment;
- Introduced an industrial turret for mining on a merchant ship;
- Introduced projects for production: titanium ingot, industrial turret, batteries, microcircuits, power propulsion components;
- Added new content for the generator of distant sectors (optimization drawdowns are possible - we will finalize this in patch fixes);
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/35716072/41fb998ae6fc71964b5e717d095df09221f04762.jpg[/img]
See you in the Arcanum system!

Fixed disappearance of a neutral sector if there is a station in it;
Fixed display of the station building process;
Fixed a bug when selling resources to the station (goods at the station were not added);
Fixed turret behavior: automatic uncontrolled shooting;
Fixed the behavior of a merchant when completing a contract: now he does not become hostile if you shot another merchant;
Fixed displacement of equipment icons in equipment mode when changing the interface scale;

Tired of patch fixes? :)
In the next update, we are planning to release a player rating mechanic, as well as a New Year's patch coming soon! :)

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/35716072/6ab164f043ee08430d5aae3e468ad71cd1294e9e.png[/img]- Fixed accumulation of a large number of pirates after failed contracts;
- Fixed the appearance of merchant ships far from the sector, when hyperjumping;
- Fixed disappearance of patrol ships from sectors;
- Fixed a few more bugs with mining (yes, there were really a lot of bugs!);
- Now different ships have a limit on the maximum power of the shield. A light fighter cannot mount a shield against a heavy ship.

Added a new type of contracts: cargo delivery;
Improved pirate behavior;
The reaction of patrol ships to criminals has been improved;
Reduced the amount of space debris in sectors;
The required rank for the purchase of the Ranger ship has been increased to 18;
Fixed numerous problems with the execution of contracts;
Fixed a bug when completing a contract for the supply of the station;
Fixed mining: a problem during the disappearance of the mini-game UI;
Bug fixed: picking up an item whose weight exceeds the space in the cargo hold;

Fixed a bug when completing a station supply contract;
Fixed reset of open sectors when restarting the game;
Fixed a bug when selling engines;
Fixed a problem in physics calculations in a collision (infinite rotation of the ship);
The collisions of players' ships are temporarily disabled;
Improved contract UI;

The game version has been updated!
Update List:
- Mechanics of creating a group / corporation;
- Setting the rules within the sector;
- Now you can build your own station!
- Added intruder system;
- Deepened the mechanics of ore mining;
- Added graphics settings;
- Now contract pirates appear only in neutral (dangerous) sectors;
- We gradually began work on localizing the game;
- New replicas for OS "FRIEND";
- New voice acting for NPC;
- The effect of accelerating the ship has been worked out;
- Added a new cockpit model. There will be more new models in the next patches. 😊

Among other things, some textures have been improved, including new outer space backgrounds.[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/35716072/49c812241a1c5c663fe34006ea244e20551413d3.jpg[/img]

Over the past months, many mechanics have been worked out, as well as new ones introduced.
List of innovations:
- Added several new sectors, the galactic map has been reformed;
- Added new resources for extracting them from meteorites;
- Now you can extract resources not only in the miner's belt;
- Now more time is given to supply the station with resources;
- Now NPC ships are assembled by the server in the same way as the player's ship: the NPC ship now actually has modules such as engine, shields, weapons installed, and all this affects the characteristics and class of the ship. All of this is subject to drop mechanics;
- Now, the rarer the item, the less likely it will drop when the ship dies (equivalent for players and NPCs). That is, now it is not always possible to fly after death and collect the entire set of your equipment. Some of the items are destroyed by explosion;
- Added division of contracts by difficulty. Now, if you take on the task "Destroy the pirate" of low complexity, then you will have to fight with the pirate who has the weakest weapons (and vice versa).
- Trade NPC ships now carry more resources, the more powerful their ship is equipped; Trade NPCs issue contracts with a payment corresponding to their equipment (the more heavily equipped a merchant is, the more valuable he is to transport goods - the more dangerous are defense contracts - the more money for execution);
- Rewritten the combat behavior of NPC ships. Now they can fly around obstacles during a battle, attack you from behind, maneuver, retreat if their shields are at their limit and make a variety of decisions based on the situation;
- Trade NPCs have finally learned how to handle turrets on their trade yachts;
- Fixed a number of bugs;
- Improved some visual effects.

This ship is a medium fighter with good combat power and excellent maneuverability.

By the way, there will be several classes of ships in the game:
- Light fighters;
- Medium fighters;
- Heavy fighters;
- Merchant ships;
- battle corvettes;
“Perhaps even huge destroyers!”

In addition to the fact that the player can purchase any class of the ship - he is also unlimited in the number of ships that he can own!

Expect news, in October we will try to tell as much interesting information about the project as possible.
